  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb; fully regular",
    "Always followed by **con**: *conformarse con algo* = to make do with / to settle for something",
    "Past participle: *conformado*",
    "*No me conformo con menos* — I won't settle for less",
    "*¿Te conformas con eso?* — Are you happy with that? / Will you make do with that?",
    "Non-reflexive *conformar* = to form, to constitute, to shape (*Los países que conforman la UE* — The countries that make up the EU)",
    "*conforme* (adjective) = satisfied, in agreement (*Estoy conforme* — I'm happy with that / I agree)"
  ],
